job_post_detail.description:
1、深入理解公司与部门的业务模式及业务规划，结合业务需求及市场情况，协助制定和执行招聘计划；
2、负责招聘全流程的把控与提效包括但不限于：梳理招聘需求，明确人才画像，利用不同渠道访寻人选，人选的筛选与面试，专业的人选评价与定薪定级，offer谈判与背调入职跟进等；
3、沉淀和更新行业与人才洞察，行业情报等工作。如mapping，行业研究等insight，并与业务部门就人才招聘中的问题与挑战进行探讨拉齐，以保证双方或多方的期望统一，分清主次达成目标；
4、根据工作目标的需要，协调各方面资源，调动各方面的积极性，以解决目标实现过程中的各种问题；
5、根据现状与未来业务需要，分析管理团队现状与需求，识别发展与保留人才，搭建可持续发展的人才梯队。

Main Responsibilities:
1. Thoroughly understand the business model and planning of the company and department, and assist in formulating and executing recruitment plans based on business needs and market conditions;
2. Be responsible for controlling and improving the efficiency of the entire recruitment process, including but not limited to sorting out recruitment needs, clarifying talent profiles, searching for candidates through different channels, screening and interviewing candidates, conducting professional candidate evaluations and salary and level determination, negotiating offers, conducting background checks, and following up on employee entry;
3. Accumulate and update industry and talent insights, such as mapping and industry research, and discuss with the business department on issues and challenges in talent recruitment to ensure the alignment of expectations among multiple parties, prioritize tasks, and achieve goals;
4. Coordinate resources and mobilize enthusiasm from various aspects to solve various problems in the process of achieving work goals;
5. Analyze the current status and future business needs of the management team, identify talent for development and retention, and establish a sustainable talent pipeline.
